From bde71cef4f165f90d0a8dea5e58115feb11e3220 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: huadongyang <2482665114@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 13:00:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add: support A5 URMA workspace staging

- Add a5sim URMA deferred completion backend and demo coverage
- Wire A5 onboard host runtime to PTO-ISA URMA workspace setup
- Support CANN root and arch-root toolchain/include/library layouts
- Add workspace assertions for A5 comm hardware smoke tests
- Document the current HUGE_FIRST allocation policy for URMA windows
